  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the project is to improve the counter-terrorism (CT) and transnational organised crime (TOC)-specific intelligence-gathering and analysis capacities of law enforcement agencies in order to provide better security around the Sahel border areas</narrative>
